SUMMARY:Rhythm & Reels - "Super Mario Galaxy" Movie
DESCRIPTION:Join us on select Saturday evenings at the Apex Nature Park Amphitheatre for a night of music and movies under the stars. Our 2026 music lineup boasts a variety of genres from soul to honky tonk\, Americana and beyond! So come groove with rising star Tre.Charles\, rock out with Greensboro’s Sweet Dream\, and enjoy family favorite movies under the stars at #R&RApex Bring your family and friends\, pack a picnic basket\, and come enjoy a memorable\, magical summer evening!\nConcerts begin at 7:00pm\, movies begin at dusk.\nTo learn more about the event visit thehalle.org!
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/rhythm-reels-super-mario-galaxy-movie/
LOCATION:Apex Nature Park Amphitheatre\, 2600 Evans Rd\, Apex\, 27502
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/RR-social-posts-9-5.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Halle Cultural Arts Center":MAILTO:halleculturalartscenter@apexnc.org
END:VEVENT
